    <string name="ride_meter_name">Ride Meter</string>
    <string name="ride_meter_description">Speed on a dial with numbers, plus distance or average speed, two spots above the dial (default: shifting battery and gear; SRAM AXS, or Shimano Di2 via Ki2), and three round fields you choose in Settings. Follows the Karoo light or dark mode. Best in a large field.</string>

